    \ at: 2026-11-01T12:00:00Z}\natem:\n  line: Meadow closes each customer's books overnight once the bank feeds\
    \ arrive, locks the day, and retries a failed close before anyone opens the summary.\n  focus: How Meadow's\
    \ overnight close works, what it guarantees, and what it waits on.\n  push: Trust the morning summary, because\
    \ every day is locked and a failed close is caught before seven.\n  pull: The summary is only as early as the\
    \ bank feeds, which Meadow does not control, so a late feed still delays it.\nshorts:\n  - {path: close.short-2026-10-22-0931.md,\
    \ at: 2026-10-22T09:31:12Z, by: g40-04, mode: model, order: told}\nnodes:\n  # --- I: Inspiration -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\
